    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>Game Info</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Headphones are highly recommended for the best experience. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: Short game of around\u00a0<strong>25 to 35 minutes</strong> for first-time players. Completionists or returning players may finish faster.     </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note: there is no save system. (but there is ending replay system)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move  <br>Shift - Run  <br>Interact - G<br>ESC - Options<br>Endings: There are two endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just moved into apartment 307 in an old Korean-style hallway apartment. <br>The unit above you, 407, has long been abandoned \u2014 or so everyone says.  <br>But strange noises echo from the ceiling, lights flicker, and doors creak open on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>first-person psychological horror experience</strong> that focuses on tension and atmosphere.<br>Explore narrow hallways, creaking elevators, and eerily quiet homes, all meticulously modeled after real Korean apartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover journals, strange area, and disturbing events as you uncover the truth behind the building\u2019s silence.  <br>Every creak, shadow, and subtle sound is designed to make your skin crawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfae First-person immersive <strong>psychological horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfe2 Realistic recreation of <strong>Korean-style hallway apartments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udd0d Narrative-driven gameplay with clue-based exploration </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Tension built through silence, shadows, and subtle movement </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfa7 Carefully designed ambient sounds and lighting for full immersion </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705\u00a0<strong>Recommended For</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fans of slow-burning, atmospheric horror </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players who enjoy <strong>psychological tension</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Anyone looking for a unique <strong>Asian horror setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>Game Info</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Headphones are highly recommended for the best experience. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: Short game of around\u00a0<strong>25 to 35 minutes</strong> for first-time players. Completionists or returning players may finish faster.     </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note: there is no save system. (but there is ending replay system)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>Controls:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move  <br>Shift - Run  <br>Interact - G<br>ESC - Options<br>Endings: There are two endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just moved into apartment 307 in an old Korean-style hallway apartment. <br>The unit above you, 407, has long been abandoned \u2014 or so everyone says.  <br>But strange noises echo from the ceiling, lights flicker, and doors creak open on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>first-person psychological horror experience</strong> that focuses on tension and atmosphere.<br>Explore narrow hallways, creaking elevators, and eerily quiet homes, all meticulously modeled after real Korean apartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover journals, strange area, and disturbing events as you uncover the truth behind the building\u2019s silence.  <br>Every creak, shadow, and subtle sound is designed to make your skin crawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfae First-person immersive <strong>psychological horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfe2 Realistic recreation of <strong>Korean-style hallway apartments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udd0d Narrative-driven gameplay with clue-based exploration </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Tension built through silence, shadows, and subtle movement </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfa7 Carefully designed ambient sounds and lighting for full immersion </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705\u00a0<strong>Recommended For</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fans of slow-burning, atmospheric horror </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Players who enjoy <strong>psychological tension</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Anyone looking for a unique <strong>Asian horror setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
